{"v":4,"catch":"為所有遊戲愛好者呈獻的機甲動作遊戲","desc":"於槍林彈雨的戰場上自由馳騁，充滿爽快感的流暢戰鬥動作。\n支援Nitendo Switch的多人遊戲模式，隨心所欲享受機甲動作遊戲所帶來的樂趣。\n\n故事舞台設定於遭逢歷劫的世界，月球的墜落造成人類面臨存亡的危機。玩家作為一名傭兵在一片極度混亂的戰地中力求生存。\n\n與暴走AI的戰鬥中，各人的相遇以及彼此交錯的想法。主角最終到達的結局，所看到的光景是……。","publisher":"Marvelous Entertainment","release":"2025-09-09","genres":["動作"],"players":"單機 1 人 · 本機通訊 1–4 人 · 網路 1–4 人","langs":["日文","英文","中文 (簡體)","中文 (繁體)"],"pmax":4,"poff":1,"rating":"輔12歳級","size":"Switch 2 7.4GB / Switch 7.4GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/8192bd3d9df993d962bd38a857d944d5cd43233a79c39e711a6497c3d9a29d3a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/aef9b0f9ef38ae051a38110912e737c6c25133623b2d9caad13665698d9cfa82.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/bdb87b173fe98e871ca1627852b3710c043b33cf2aa1249a7130e74e3ca9f0a2.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/dddf6f331cc3aefb0aa43bbd59990e9d73e927198c11cccfc79b38613a973e7c.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/553a25e88c34e41390353d0df09cb198f0f6113709ffc31fcb4f44c3cc0b0160.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c156b5311e5bbc3e2dfa6b4b4d416d038cddd67cb15df6fabd56ad7906700176.jpg"],"titleId":"0100cb8005b26000","dlc":[{"id":"70050000060498","name":"兵裝機甲用外觀『木紋』","img":"e557f20cf7d46af43ab43737af58bac18a23acc17dbe91b04ef6ff0ab0ec265e","date":"2025-09-09","mem":false},{"id":"70050000060499","name":"兵裝機甲用外觀『花』","img":"f733e18145a98227d5b881483ed9385452ecca7d1f768d386373bdc0c6affb11","date":"2025-09-09","mem":false},{"id":"70050000060500","name":"兵裝機甲用外觀『波紋』","img":"273e779cd38485c631d66988f41b2a114410e20363c034342dd084c514310169","date":"2025-09-09","mem":false},{"id":"70050000060501","name":"兵裝機甲用外觀『香檳金』","img":"4efadc0fa70f9bea54f211f0ce15dc3d0ae43d6ae5b473085064b6c7adfa3d5a","date":"2025-09-09","mem":false},{"id":"70050000060502","name":"兵裝機甲用外觀『珍珠白』","img":"55ca882e45b0a3c019d8852b58b14bab218516a944c0ee5a396887c48af623bc","date":"2025-09-09","mem":false},{"id":"70050000060503","name":"能力者用感情動作『街舞』","img":"46a4d307575